# Cusimanse project instructions

The Markdown contract defines the research question, authorization, scope and acceptance criteria. The experiment recipe is the single executable configuration source.

Use Goose as the reference primary operator. Other agents may operate the same recipe only through a validated adapter or prompt handoff.

Reference experiments execute workloads inside disposable Lima/QEMU VMs. Start the declared instrumentation before the workload. Never execute the approved workload on the host.

Use project Skills and specialist subagents for focused work. Keep independent analysis separate from the primary lifecycle. Do not introduce a second orchestration controller.

Raw runtime artifacts are evidence. Model output is analysis only. Preserve evidence and provenance before VM destruction.

Do not access unrelated credentials, host data or mounts. Keep provider credentials outside Git.
